# Local dev secrets — copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your keys.
# Both files are gitignored (see .gitignore lines `.env`, `.env.local`).
#
# These keys are read by:
#   - vite.config.ts → vitePluginLLMProxyDev() during `pnpm dev`
#   - Vercel runtime → api/llm.ts after deploy (set the same keys under
#     Vercel project → Settings → Environment Variables)
#
# Provider selection happens client-side (Settings page → Provider). The
# proxy forwards via the `x-llm-provider` header and picks the matching
# key here. You only need to set keys for providers you actually use.

DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-your-deepseek-key-here
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-openai-key-here
